# Keep generated WASM bindings tracked — they're small (~54KB) and needed for Vercel builds.
#
# The _bg.wasm binaries are NOT tracked here: they are served from public/wasm/ and the
# worklet glue's async-init path is rewritten to that served location. A co-located
# _bg.wasm under this directory is always a stale, schema-mismatched twin (WB-2 / #657),
# so the pattern below keeps one from being re-added and `pnpm wasm:verify` fails on any
# that slips in.
*_bg.wasm